flowchart TD
classDef default fill:#e8eaf6,stroke:#455a64,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#000
linkStyle default stroke:#455a64,stroke-width:1.5px
classDef store fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#455a64,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#000
classDef agent fill:#e0f2f1,stroke:#455a64,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#000
classDef unchanged fill:#eceff1,stroke:#607d8b,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#000,stroke-dasharray: 3 3

CreateCurriculum["User creates a curriculum"]
ExplicitCheck{"Node chosen explicitly?"}
ManualRow["Confirmed mapping row (manual)"]
SubjectType{"Subject has a static taxonomy?"}
OldPlacement["Resolve Domain Placement (unchanged)"]:::unchanged
AutoRow["Auto-confirmed mapping row"]
Taxonomy["Static Taxonomy Nodes (seeded once)"]:::store
Trigger["User clicks Map to taxonomy"]
MapAgent["Domain Taxonomy Mapping Agent"]:::agent
Suggested["Suggested mapping rows"]
Review["User approves / adjusts / rejects"]
Confirmed["Confirmed mapping rows"]
Unmatched["Unmatched topic -> existing new-node suggestion flow"]
MappingTable["curriculum_domain_node_mappings (many-to-many)"]:::store
Map["Subject Domain Map"]:::store

CreateCurriculum --> ExplicitCheck
ExplicitCheck -->|yes, any subject| ManualRow
ManualRow --> MappingTable
ExplicitCheck -->|no| SubjectType
SubjectType -->|no taxonomy| OldPlacement
OldPlacement --> AutoRow
AutoRow --> MappingTable
SubjectType -->|has taxonomy| Trigger
Trigger --> MapAgent
Taxonomy --> MapAgent
MapAgent --> Suggested
MapAgent -->|no match for a topic| Unmatched
Suggested --> Review
Review --> Confirmed
Confirmed --> MappingTable
MappingTable --> Map
